.*
.* WRKWTR: the printer writers, their devices and queues.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CNTCL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=WRITER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVICE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=FORMTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PRINTED CLASS=CNTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=WRITERS VARS='OPT WRITER DEVICE STATUS FORMTYPE OUTQ LIB PRINTED'.
:KEYL NAME=WTRKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKWTR KEYL=WTRKEYS HELP=WRKWTR ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with All Printers
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=WRITERS.(No writers started)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.3=Hold
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD ?ENDWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.4=End
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.6=Release
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKOUTQ OUTQ(&LIB./&OUTQ.)'.8=Work with output queue
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=WRITER USAGE=OUTPUT.Writer
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVICE USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Sts
:LISTCOL VAR=FORMTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Form Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output Queue
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=PRINTED USAGE=OUTPUT.Printed
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKWTR.Work with Printers - Help
:P.The writers started on the system: the device each prints on, the
output queue it takes files from and how many it has printed.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
